[i]You peek through the peephole. There is a boy standing in the rain. He's soaked. He knocks again and glances behind himself, like he's scared hes being followed.[/i]
[i]He knocks once more.[/i]
- Open the door. He's drenched.
- You already let the other girl in, what's one more?
- Minerva wouldn't be too happy if I denied this guy shelter.
[i]You open the door. the boy seems delighted.[/i]
Silas (Happy): "Finally! I've been looking for somebody else for weeks! I'm {Silas.name}, by the way."
[signal arg="2000"]
- It's nice to meet you.
	Player (Default): "It's nice to meet you."
	Silas (Happy): "Yeah! It's really nice to meet you too! Would I be able to stay here for a little bit? Until the rain passes by, at least."
	- You can stay as long as you want
		Player (Default): "You can stay as long as you want. I've already got one other person here for the storm, and the more the merrier."
		Silas (Happy): "Oh! Someone else is already here? That's great! How long would you be comfortable with me staying for?"
		Player (Default): "I already told you. You can stay as long as you want to."
		Silas (Sad): "Sorry, I was just making sure that I wouldn't be overstaying my welcome or anything."
	- I don't see why not.
		Player (Default): "I don't see why not. Someone else is already staying here for the storm, so I guess one more couldn't hurt."
		Silas (Happy): "Really? Thank you so much!"
	- Just until the rain passes.
		Player (Default): "You can stay until the rain passes. It's probably not great to be sitting in the rain."
		Silas (Happy): "Thank you so much! I'll try to stay out of the way until then."
		set {Timeline_Managment.SilasInt1_1Leave} = 1.0
- He can stay until the rain passes.
	Player (Default): "Come on in. You can stay here until the rain passes."
	Silas (Happy): "Thank you so much!"
	set {Timeline_Managment.SilasInt1_1Leave} = 1.0
[i]{Silas.name} comes into the building and marvels at the lobby.[/i]
[i]You seem to be unable to keep his name in your head as well...
Silas (Happy): "I haven't been on campus since before everything went down. It's amazing how you've managed to keep this place up and running!"
- I do my best.
	Player (Default): "I do my best. It's not too hard with nothing else really to do."
- Yeah, I'm pretty surprised as well.
	Player (Default): "Yeah, I'm pretty surprised as well. I'm not sure how I manage to do it."
Silas (Default): "It's really cool anyway."
[i]{Silas.name} sits down at a table and looks out the front window before looking in his bag. He takes out a book and begins reading.[/i]
